QuestGuidance.Register("en",141,{
[4481]="7005152C\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Dwarf-holds barter currency allowance.\n",
[4482]="70018C16\n1\tChip ice from the frozen waterfall\030Gather berries from the bushes (total: 3)\tThe frozen waterfall and the berry-bushes can be found around a frozen lake to the west of the gate of Thorin's Hall. Imi has asked you to go to the waterfall and pick some berries from a specific bush around the frozen lake.\n2\tBring the ice and berries to Imi\tImi is inside Thorin's Hall, near the main entrance. Imi will be pleased to see that you have gathered several berries and some chipped ice for his dessert ingredients.\n",
[4483]="7000AB8A\n1\tBring the dwarf-jewels to Ísrath\030Collect Dwarf-jewels (total: 5)\tThe Blue Stone Garrison is located just inside Thorin's Hall. Ísrath has requested that you bring him crafted dwarf-jewels.\n",
[4484]="7000AB8E\n1\tBring the dwarf-necklace to Ísrath\030Collect a dwarf-necklace\tThe Blue Stone Garrison is located just inside Thorin's Hall. Ísrath has requested that you bring him a crafted dwarf-necklace.\n",
[4485]="7000AB8C\n1\tBring the dwarf-rings to Ísrath\030Collect dwarf-rings (total: 5)\tThe Blue Stone Garrison is located just inside Thorin's Hall. Ísrath has requested that you bring him crafted dwarf-rings.\n",
[4486]="7005AAF5\n1\tCollect goat meat from rams (total: 10)\tNáth has asked you to hunt some of the local rams for meat. You should hunt the rams and collect goat meat.\n2\tTalk to Náth\tYou have hunted the local rams and collected some of their meat. You should talk to Náth at Fellgát.\n",
[4487]="7000E5F0\n1\tTalk to Thórth\tZigilgund is far along the road to the west of Pynti-peldot. Ora suggested that you speak with a dwarf there by the name of Thórth.\n",
[4488]="7005AB16\n1\tAssist fighting dwarves by defeating their opponents and delivering new orders (total: 8)\tThe Dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ are fighting the Battle of Uzdarulzahar. You should assist fighting dwarves in Uzdarulzahar by helping them defeat their opponents and then giving them new orders.\n2\tThe battle of Uzdarulzahar proceeds!\t\n",
[4489]="700088DB\n1\tDefeat Isendeep Miner (total: 5)\tThe Isendeep mine lay to the west of Grothum. If there are no dwarves within the mine, make your way to the western entrance and search for them there. Gasham asked you to enter the mine and slaughter the dwarves so the goblins can return to work.\n2\tTalk to Gasham\tGasham awaits news of the mines at Grothum, the goblin-village in the north-east Ettenmoors. You entered the mine and slaughtered all the dwarves you found. You should return to Gasham with the news.\n",
[4490]="7004DA40\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroath.\n",
[4491]="7004DA41\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[4492]="7004DA43\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[4493]="7004DC16\n1\tDeliver the Rusted Scimitars to a collection box\030Collect Rusted Scimitars (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire Rusted Scimitars.\n",
[4494]="7001BF9C\n1\tBring the Orc-weapons to Logi at Iorvinas\030Collect Orc-weapons (total: 8)\tOrcs and Dourhands can be found in the area of Iorvinas. Logi is at Iorvinas. Upon discovering that the Orcs and Dourhands were living in close proximity, Logi began to fear that the two were working together as well. He has asked you to collect any proof that this collusion may be happening.\n",
[4495]="70053E31\n1\tSpeak to the occupants of the dwelling\tThe ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath. You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.\n2\tComplete: Rot for the Fire\030Complete: Questionable Meal\tThe ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath. You should speak to the occupants of the dwelling.\n3\tTalk to the strange child\tThe ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath. You should speak to the occupants of the broken-down house.\n4\tFind the child's toy\tThe child's lost toy must be somewhere nearby. You should search for the child's toy.\n5\tReturn to the ramshackle dwelling\030Defeat the treacherous spirits (total: 2)\tThe ramshackle dwelling sits in the hills of northern Rath Dúath. You should return to the broken-down dwelling to further your investigations.\n6\tCompleted\tDefeated the watching stone's grip on your mind.\n",
[4496]="7003032E\n1\tRepair mechanisms in the Dwergfant (total: 6)\tThe impaired mechanisms can be found within the Dwergfant. Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and repair the mechanisms within.\n2\tTalk to Aldbéort\tAldbéort is awaiting you at Cliving. Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that the Dwergfant is fully functional again.\n",
[4497]="7002F305\n1\tDefeat avanc and toads in the Dwergfant (total: 10)\tAvanc and toads can be found at Dwergfant. Aldbéort has asked you to venture to the Dwergfant and defeat the avanc and toads found within.\n2\tTalk to Aldbéort\tAldbéort is at Cliving. Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the avanc and toad population in the Dwergfant has been thinned.\n",
[4498]="7001CEF0\n1\tSearch for the first scout in Dannenglor\030Search for the second scout in Dannenglor\030Search for the third scout in Dannenglor\tThe missing Malledhrim scouts can surely be found in Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn. You should search Dannenglor for the missing Elves, though whether they are alive or dead is yet to be seen.\n2\tTalk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn\tFernachar is in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor. You should speak with Fernachar and tell him that the three scouts met their doom in Dannenglor.\n",
[4499]="700479DC\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Dûm Boha\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should destroy Haradrim supplies stored around the encampment.\n2\tDestroy Haradrim supplies (total: 10)\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should destroy Haradrim supplies stored around the encampment.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many Haradrim supplies in Dûm Boha.\n",
[4500]="70053E2F\n1\tDestroy defiled bones and altars of sacrifice in Dáru Lagúrz\tDáru Lagúrz can be found in Rath Dúath. You should destroy defiled bones and altars of sacrifice in Dáru Lagúrz.\n2\tDestroy defiled bones (total: 12)\030Destroy altars of sacrifice (total: 8)\tDáru Lagúrz can be found in Rath Dúath. You should destroy defiled bones and altars of sacrifice in Dáru Lagúrz.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many defiled bones and altars of sacrifice in Dáru Lagúrz.\n",
[4501]="70053E37\n1\tDefeat kergrim at Dáru Lagúrz\tKergrim can be found at Dáru Lagúrz in Rath Dúath. You should defeat kergrim at Dáru Lagúrz.\n2\tDefeat kergrim ravagers (total: 6)\030Defeat kergrim prowlers (total: 6)\030Defeat kergrim invokers (total: 2)\tKergrim can be found at Dáru Lagúrz in Rath Dúath. You should defeat kergrim at Dáru Lagúrz.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated hosts of kergrim at Dáru Lagúrz.\n",
[4502]="7005479A\n1\tDestroy the evil sarcophagi\tEvil sarcophagi can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should destroy the sarcophagi.\n2\tDestroy the evil sarcophagi (total: 12)\tEvil Sarcophagi can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should destroy the sarcophagi.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many of the evil sarcophagi in Dâr Grazadh.\n",
[4503]="7005479F\n1\tDefeat foes at Dâr Grazadh\tMany foes can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should defeat any foes you find.\n2\tDefeat foes at Dâr Grazadh (total: 12)\tMany foes can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should defeat any foes you find.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many foes at Dâr Grazadh.\n",
[4504]="7005479C\n1\tSearch the caskets for untouched remains\tCaskets can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should search the caskets for untouched remains.\n2\tSearch caskets\030Find untouched remains (total: 10)\tCaskets can be found in Dâr Grazadh. You should search the caskets for untouched remains.\n3\tBring the untouched remains to Damrod in Barad Orhant\tDamrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul. You should bring the untouched remains to Damrod.\n",
[4505]="700192D2\n1\tDefeat weak Globsnaga Orcs (total: 18)\tThe new Globsnaga Orcs can be found throughout Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of the Foundations of Stone in Moria. Donfuin has asked you to slaughter the weaker, newly-altered Orcs to prevent their use as carriers of the fungus they are now infested with.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin stands outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria. You should speak with Donfuin and inform him of your success against the weak Glabsnaga Orcs in Dâr Narbugud.\n",
[4506]="700192CE\n1\tDefeat Rung\030Defeat Blagh\tThe trolls you seek can be found in Dâr Narbugud, near the Dark Delvings at the southernmost tip of the Foundations of Stone. Donfuin has asked you to defeat the trolls' leaders, which should disorganize the trolls and deflate their usefulness in battle.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin stands just outside of Dâr Narbugud. You should speak with Donfuin and inform him of your victory over the troll-leaders.\n",
[4507]="700193D1\n1\tDefeat Zholuga\030Defeat Îstum\030Defeat Flâgît\tThe leaders of the Globsnaga can be found in Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of the Foundations of Stone. You should defeat each leader of the Globsnaga to sever the head of the force that rallies in in Dâr Narbugud.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria. You should speak with Donfuin and tell him of your success against the leaders of the plague-bearing Orcs.\n",
[4508]="700192D1\n1\tDestroy fumaroles (total: 13)\030Destroy greater fumaroles (total: 3)\tThe greater fumaroles can be found in Dâr Narbugud, at the southern tip of the Foundations of Stone. Donfuin has asked you to destroy the fumaroles that belch their noxious fumes into the poisoned chambers of Dâr Narbugud.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin can be found outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria. You should go to Donfuin and inform him of your success in destroying the belching fumaroles of Dâr Narbugud.\n",
[4509]="700192D3\n1\tUse Phial of Pure Water\030Purify the liquid in Îstum's plague-chamber\030Purify the liquid in Zholuga's plague-chamber\030Purify the liquid in Flâgît's plague-chamber\tThe chambers of rancour can be found in Dâr Narbugud, in the southern-most reaches of Moria's Foundations of Stone. You should use the contents of the phial to cleanse the rancourous chambers of transformation within Dâr Narbugud.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria. You should return to Donfuin and inform him of your success in purifying the most corrupted places in Moria.\n",
[4510]="700192CF\n1\tBring the hilt to Celeborn at Caras Galadhon\tCeleborn can be found in Lothlórien's main city, Caras Galadhon. You should show the corrupted hilt you have found to Celeborn, whose wisdom and long memory may dispel the mystery surrounding this artifact.\n2\tFind someone who may recognize the hilt\tCeleborn believes that the sword hilt will be recognizeable to someone who lives in Lothlórien. He surmises, based on the words on the handle, that the warrior of old was a loyal protector of the Golden Wood. You should seek someone who may recognize the befouled relic.\n",
[4511]="700192D0\n1\tDefeat the Mistress of Pestilence\030Defeat the Blind One\tThe source of the pestilence in Moria is near the Dark Delvings at the southernmost tip of the Foundations of Stone, in a foul place called Dâr Narbugud. Donfuin wishes you and your allies to defeat the Nameless sources of the sickness spewing from Dâr Narbugud, thus removing the threat of the fungal plague's spread.\n2\tTalk to Donfuin\tDonfuin is outside of Dâr Narbugud in Moria. You should tell Celeborn of your very great deed in defeating the Mistress of Pestilence in Moria.\n",
[4512]="700195A4\n1\tTalk to Celeborn at Caras Galadhon\tCeleborn is in Caras Galadhon, at the heart of Lothlórien. You should speak with Celeborn at the behest of Baranglim to gain his counsel about the final and most important task to be achieved in Moria.\n2\tUse the phial of light\tDâr Narbugud is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria, to the south-east near the Dark Delvings. Celeborn has given you a phial of Elven light to bring to the heart of plague, sickness, and corruption within Moria.\n3\tTalk to Celeborn at Caras Galadhon\tCeleborn stands at the heart of Lothlórien, in the hidden city of Caras Galadhon. You should speak with Celeborn and share the tale of your great success in Dâr Narbugud, dealing a heavy blow to the creatures who would cover the world in sickness.\n",
})
